sentence, right? They don't get promoted by advocating for your release from prison. They

00:36:03.680 --> 00:36:10.160
get promoted by being as tough and mean and strong and ruthless and brutal as they possibly can.

00:36:10.160 --> 00:36:18.880
Leonard Peltier is a really great example. Not only is he old and in poor health,

