the least you can do is allow a commutation. I just don't understand it.

00:37:33.360 --> 00:37:38.720
Yeah, I mean, there are so many people who should have that commutation, who should have that pardon.

00:37:38.720 --> 00:37:44.240
I think, John, I include you in that list. I think, you know, among many, many others.

00:37:44.240 --> 00:37:44.560
Thank you, of course.

00:37:44.560 --> 00:37:48.400
So I wanted to ask, I mean, there are, you know, people know about whistleblowers like

