people to take a look at Daniel Hale right off the bat. Daniel Hale is a young guy,

00:38:29.920 --> 00:38:36.320
young whistleblower who blew the whistle on the U.S. government's drone program, right?

00:38:37.120 --> 00:38:44.880
The Pentagon has always maintained that our drones are precision instruments. There are few,

00:38:44.880 --> 00:38:55.680
if any, civilian victims and Daniel Hale was a drone operator. And he said that is simply not true.

00:38:56.400 --> 00:39:05.600
