in the car. And then the guy told him, fire. Well, we're not supposed to fire. There are

00:39:31.920 --> 00:39:36.480
children in the car. There are no children in the car. I'm looking at the same feed you are, fire.

00:39:37.360 --> 00:39:45.360
Well, eventually he fired and he killed two little girls. And he said he can never forgive

00:39:45.360 --> 00:39:53.120
himself. He's a murderer and there's nothing he can do to change that. This happens all the time.

00:39:53.760 --> 00:39:59.360
You know, we've even killed famously, we killed Anwar Alaki, an American citizen,

