00:40:08.620 --> 00:40:13.300
Well, seven days later, we killed his 16-year-old son

00:40:13.300 --> 00:40:18.300
and 16-year-old nephew who were sitting at a cafe,

00:40:18.300 --> 00:40:21.100
both children, neither one of whom

