00:40:23.620 --> 00:40:26.020
And then months after the fact,

00:40:26.020 --> 00:40:27.700
the US government finally came out and said,

00:40:27.780 --> 00:40:31.740
oh, our bad, that was a bad strike.

00:40:31.740 --> 00:40:33.520
Yeah, sorry about that.

00:40:33.520 --> 00:40:35.140
Well, that's not acceptable.

00:40:36.180 --> 00:40:37.920
It's illegal, it's murder.

00:40:38.860 --> 00:40:41.780
And so Daniel Hale is the one who told us about that.

00:40:41.780 --> 00:40:44.420
Now, Daniel Hale's judge

00:40:45.780 --> 00:40:47.260
in the Eastern District of Virginia,

00:40:47.260 --> 00:40:49.580
I went to the sentencing hearing,

00:40:49.580 --> 00:40:53.140
sentenced him, I think it was to 40 months in prison.

00:40:53.140 --> 00:40:54.980
And I told Daniel that night,

00:40:54.980 --> 00:40:56.740
he called me from jail that night and I said,

00:40:56.740 --> 00:40:57.620
you know what?

00:40:57.620 --> 00:41:00.860
I said, when the judge issued the sentence,

00:41:00.860 --> 00:41:03.660
I was sitting with Tom Drake, the NSA whistleblower,

00:41:03.660 --> 00:41:07.820
and Tom and I hugged each other when we heard 40 months

00:41:07.820 --> 00:41:08.900
because the government was asking

00:41:08.900 --> 00:41:10.260
for years and years and years,

00:41:10.260 --> 00:41:13.700
